12. In view of the aforementioned, the following order is passed:
ORDER i) The appeal is allowed in part;
ii) The judgment and award dated 22.6.2015 passed in MVC No.202/2014 by the Senior Civil Judge and Additional MACT, Holalkere, is hereby modified to the extent stated herein.

iii) The claimant is entitled to a total compensation in a sum of `2,73,000/- together with interest at 6% pa., from the date of petition till its realization, which shall be paid by the insurer who is the appellant in the above appeal and second respondent before the Tribunal;
NC: 2024:KHC:6749 iv) The amount deposited by the appellant before this Court be transmitted to the Tribunal for disbursement to the claimant in terms of the award of the Tribunal.
v) The balance amount together with accrued interest shall be deposited by the appellant before the Tribunal within eight weeks from the date of receipt of a copy of this judgment;
vi) The Registry to draw the modified award accordingly.
vii) No costs.

